{"id":"f9bd4987179e7e50","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-selfdualextension.md","title":"Self-dual extension by one selector variable","display":"df-selfdualextension — Self-dual extension by one selector variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-selfdualextension","aliases":["27-df-selfdualextension"],"display":"df-selfdualextension — Self-dual extension by one selector variable","depends_on":["[[27-df-dual]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§4.1.3 Definition 4.3","source_printed_pages":"172,173","source_pdf_pages":"196,197","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-selfdualextension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-selfdualextension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-selfdualextension — Self-dual extension by one selector variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b491e41297256b44\" href=\"?note=b491e41297256b44\" title=\"27-df-dual\">27-df-dual</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.1.3 Definition 4.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"172,173"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"196,197"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dual}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Dual}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b491e41297256b44\" href=\"?note=b491e41297256b44\" title=\"27-df-dual\">27-df-dual</a>。向量按其在坐标集上的函数图表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y|_{[n]}\">\\(y|_{[n]}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n+1}\">\\(y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n+1}\\)</span> 在前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个坐标上的限制。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SD}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{SD}_n\\)</span> 是下节定义的函数构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SD}_n:\\{0,1\\}^{\\{0,1\\}^n}\\longrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{\\{0,1\\}^{n+1}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SD}_n:\\{0,1\\}^{\\{0,1\\}^n}\\longrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{\\{0,1\\}^{n+1}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SD}_n(f)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(y,(1-y_{n+1})f(y|_{[n]})+y_{n+1}\\,\\mathrm{Dual}_n(f)(y|_{[n]})\\right)\\mid y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n+1}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SD}_n(f)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(y,(1-y_{n+1})f(y|_{[n]})+y_{n+1}\\,\\mathrm{Dual}_n(f)(y|_{[n]})\\right)\\mid y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n+1}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>选择位为 0 时取原函数，选择位为 1 时取其对偶。两项绝不同时非零，故实数和仍为布尔值；域和值域显式给出。原书式 (4.7) 的首项包含选择位的负文字，PDF 纯文本提取容易丢失上横线，本页用 1−b 消除该歧义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dual","status":"resolved","id":"b491e41297256b44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dual]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dual","status":"resolved","id":"b491e41297256b44","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dual]]。向量按其在坐标集上的函数图表示；$y|_{[n]}$ 是 $y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n+1}$ 在前 $n$ 个坐标上的限制。$\\mathrm{SD}_n$ 是下节定义的函数构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dual}_n","display":false},{"tex":"y|_{[n]}","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SD}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SD}_n:\\{0,1\\}^{\\{0,1\\}^n}\\longrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{\\{0,1\\}^{n+1}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SD}_n(f)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(y,(1-y_{n+1})f(y|_{[n]})+y_{n+1}\\,\\mathrm{Dual}_n(f)(y|_{[n]})\\right)\\mid y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n+1}\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1636,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-selfdualextension|df-selfdualextension — Self-dual extension by one selector variable]]"},{"id":"d2ed815720a23b5c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$\\mathrm{SD}_n$ 见 [[27-df-selfdualextension]]，$\\mathrm{SelfDual}_{n+1}$ 见 [[27-df-selfdual]]。$B_n,B_{n+1}$ 与逆向限制映射 $R_0$ 由下式构造。"}],"outgoing":["b491e41297256b44"]}